# UI

Extend `base.html`. Keep titles in `{% block title %}`. Use existing Tailwind theme tokens (`bg-surface`, `text-on-surface`, `bg-primary-container`, etc.), Inter, and Material Symbols.

Upload progress uses `EventSource` against `/files/progress/{job_id}`. Sheet and result views use `fetch` plus query params for filters and pagination.

Do not introduce a SPA framework. Keep page JS inline or in the template unless a shared pattern already exists. After UI changes, verify the real page flow (upload, files list, sheets, reconcile, download), not only a screenshot.
